@id = 2

### Public tariff list
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tariffs
Accept: application/json

### Protected query without token
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth-check

### Protected query with access token
GET http://localhost:8081/api/auth-check
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak")}}

### Create tariff Private
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tariffs
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak")}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Домашний",
  "speed": 100,
  "price": 600.00,
  "description": "Для домашнего использования"
}

### Update tariff private
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tariffs/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak")}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Дачный",
  "speed": 200,
  "price": 123.00,
  "description": "Для использования на даче"
}

### Delete tariff private
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/tariffs/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("keycloak")}}
